## Notes: Night-only cursor torch for the TimelessForever suite. Earned in 4 tiers via class trainer and level progression. Features health dimming (0 at <=14% HP), aggro warning (vivid red), class behaviors (Warlock drain, Paladin flare, Mage spec, Hunter pet, Priest shield, Shaman totems), stealth auto-extinguish, and a realistic day/night darkness curve.
